OL,3,GNEWSATeenager converted blank-firing
OL,4,Aweapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham teenager who converted
OL,7,Fblank-firing weapons into firearms when
OL,8,Fhe was 17 has been jailed.
OL,10,FZain Hussain, now 19, from Sparkbrook,
OL,11,Fappeared at Birmingham Crown Court
OL,12,Fafter pleading guilty to possessing a
OL,13,Ffirearm and was jailed for four years
OL,14,Fand 11 months.
OL,16,FHussain had been under surveillance
OL,17,Fafter intelligence showed he was
OL,18,Finvolved in converting weapons into
OL,19,Flive-firing guns, which could be sold
OL,20,Ffor up to #3,000 on the criminal
OL,21,Fmarket, the National Crime Agency (NCA)
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
