OL,3,GNEWSATeenager converted blank-firing
OL,4,Aweapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers followed him along the Grand
OL,7,FUnion Canal in Birmingham and the
OL,8,Fdefendant was arrested in a wooded
OL,9,Farea, where he had been digging a hole,
OL,10,Fin which three firearms and ammunition
OL,11,Fwere found, the NCA said.
